xport the MRP to the Web or use the link I provided.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n**MRP**\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28671739/mrp.zip)\n\n**HOSTED ON ITCH.IO** (4.6.3 stable)\nhttps://nnrmal.itch.io/test1\nPASSWORD = \"mrp\"","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120051/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120051/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}